    "level": "middle",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "questionText": "Как делиться данными между Docker контейнерами?",
    "shortAnswer": "Файлы — shared named volume в оба контейнера. RPC/HTTP — Docker network по имени сервиса. Broadcast — Redis/Kafka queue. Read-only config — bind-mount :ro или docker config.",
    "idealAnswer": "Три паттерна: 1) Named volume — docker volume create shared, -v shared:/data в writer и reader; concurrent writes — app coordination (atomic mv, single-writer). 2) Network — api → http://worker:5000, expose, Compose DNS. Лучше чем file-as-message. 3) Queue — Redis producer/worker replicas. 4) Read-only config bind :ro или Swarm configs. --volumes-from legacy — avoid. Ошибки: shared volume для RPC; bind mount /home/user not portable; UID mismatch; RW для readers use :ro. Sidecar: app writes logs, fluentd reads :ro.",
